OL,3,GNEWSATouring car driver hopes for
OL,4,Arecord fifth title
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the British Touring Car
OL,7,FChampionship said it was "surreal" to
OL,8,Fpotentially wrap up his fifth title at
OL,9,FSilverstone - something no driver has
OL,10,Fdone before.
OL,12,FAsh Sutton drives from the
OL,13,FNorthampton-based NAPA Racing UK and is
OL,14,Fleading by 115 points in the 2026
OL,15,Fcampaign.
OL,17,FThe race at the Northamptonshire
OL,18,Fcircuit is the penultimate round of the
OL,19,Fchampionship which sees modified
OL,20,Fproduction cars, such as a Ford Focus,
OL,21,FAudi A3 or Toyota Corolla, competing.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
